To JKTBAS
Fm COV

Good day

As noticed from CTS, KPI PFS has been changed from COLI 1011W INC as below.
KRPUS TUE 20/WED 16 => WED 19/THU 15
[cid:image001.png@01CEE6D3.F7EA79F0]
KPI vessels have to advanced schedule 1.8days at first cycle to meet new PFS.
Because KRINC schedule changed from ETB THU 19:00 to ETB WED 00:00.
However, KPI vessels already delayed due to MNL congestion & typhoon.

We will try to recover delayed schedule but it seems to be very difficult to arrive PUS on PFS without port omission.

Thanks
B.rgds/SK Kim

