Dear Colleagues,

Upon our checking in the ALPS, LRS KPI schedule have different departure date from regular schedule.
Usually our KPI schedule departure from IDJKT on Monday and arrive KRPUS on Tue/Wed, however the schedule which shown on below picture have different arrival and departure from IDJKT. [cid:image002.png@01CEE6D3.F7EA79F0]

Please advice us if the schedule is already fixed or still possible to change.
We need your valuable advice accordingly, since we are concern about connection possibility between KPI and PSX/PNH/LW1/LW2/AWH with above schedule.

Highly appreciate for your valuable advice and reply.

Thanks and best regards,
Eddy Hermanto / JKTBAS

